          "end": 64.483,
          "en": "then I know the input is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.22,
          "end": 67.053,
          "en": "Now for one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.053,
          "end": 69.11,
          "en": "I will return them to a white",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.11,
          "end": 71.68,
          "en": "that this line of code here executes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.68,
          "end": 75.45,
          "en": "because returning stops the function execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 78.35,
          "en": "But in addition, I also wanna show my alert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.35,
          "end": 81.28,
          "en": "and I could do this with the built in alert function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.28,
          "end": 83.74,
          "en": "but I wanna have my own custom dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.74,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "which looks a bit nicer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 88.75,
          "en": "and therefore I will add a new component",
