        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 388.17,
          "end": 392.79,
          "en": "With that, the dialogue is registered now in ad resource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 392.79,
          "end": 395.57,
          "en": "we can use it and here it should be shown.",
