        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 395.57,
          "end": 398.08299999999997,
          "en": "If the user entered something invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 399.63,
          "end": 402.13,
          "en": "for data I'll add my data property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 402.13,
          "end": 404.67,
          "en": "to the add resource component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 404.67,
          "end": 407.81,
          "en": "And the one piece of data I wanna manage in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 407.81,
          "end": 409.43,
          "en": "is information about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 409.43,
          "end": 412.63,
          "en": "whether the user input is invalid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 412.63,
          "end": 416.52,
          "en": "So I will name my property here, input is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 416.52,
          "end": 419.86,
          "en": "And initially that's false because initially the user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 419.86,
          "end": 423.83,
          "en": "isn't invalid yet because the user didn't have a chance of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 423.83,
          "end": 424.923,
          "en": "entering anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 426.17,
          "end": 430.4,
          "en": "but I'll set this to true if we make it into the safe check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 430.4,
          "end": 434.33,
          "en": "So if at least one of these inputs is empty, then I'll set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
